To build qore from git, the following tools are required:
* CMake 3.14 or later
* A C++ compiler with C++17 support
* flex 2.5.31+
* bison 1.85+

See the BUILDING file for the full list of required and optional dependencies.

Building from git:

    mkdir build; cd build
    cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr
    make
    make install

** NOTE: now that qore has stable API and ABIs, modules have been moved to separate git repos; you can find module source here:
   * https://github.com/qorelanguage

